{"id":"revolucio_n","lemma":"revolución","pos":"noun","rank":1929,"glosses":["revolution (political/social)","revolution (act of revolving)"],"ipa":"/reboluˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"revoluciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-revoluci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"La revolución ha traído muchos cambios.","en":"The revolution has brought about many changes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767659","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"used, worn"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"change, shift","l":"cambio"}]},{"text":"La revolución introdujo una nueva era.","en":"The revolution ushered in a new era.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34479","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to insert","l":"introducir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"news, novelty"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"}]},{"text":"Las revoluciones que fracasan son rápidamente olvidadas.","en":"Revolutions that don't succeed are soon forgotten.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to fail, flop, lose","l":"fracasar"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"rapidly, quickly"},{"g":"forgotten","l":"olvidado"}]},{"text":"La revolución dividió muchas familias.","en":"The revolution divided many families.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to divide","l":"dividir"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"family","l":"familia"}]},{"text":"Ellos no tomaron parte en la revolución social.","en":"They took no part in the social revolution.","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},{"g":"part"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"social"}]}]}